==Description==
'''Monster Mash''' is an [[Emotes|emote]] that can be bought in the store for {{Coins|300}}. It was made by [https://www.roblox.com/users/1/profile Roblox]. The emote is looped and no music can be heard while performing the emote. You can move while performing this emote.

