==Trivia==
*The original animation for '''Monster Mash''' was taken from the {{RLinkC|36042821|Monster Mash Dance Potion}} gear from the Roblox catalog.
**The music that used to play while this emote was performed was also taken from the gear.
*This was one of the first emotes to be added to the game.

